&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4877&quot;&gt;Familiarity with connecting LLMs to external tools, including multi-agent systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
